"{\n  \"reasoning\": \"INFEASIBLE: To meet GBW >= 100\u202fMHz with CL = 5\u202fpF requires gm1 = 2\u03c0\u00b7CL\u00b7GBW \u2248 3.14\u202fmS. With the power limit 100\u202f\u00b5W at VDD=3.3\u202fV, the total bias current is limited to 2\u00b7Itail \u2264 30\u202f\u00b5A, so Itail \u2264 15\u202f\u00b5A and each input transistor can draw at most Id \u2248 7.5\u202f\u00b5A. The required gm/Id would be gm1/Id \u2248 3.14\u202fmS / 7.5\u202f\u00b5A \u2248 420\u202fV\u207b\u00b9, far above the allowed range (4\u201324\u202fV\u207b\u00b9). Therefore the GBW specification cannot be satisfied within the given power budget using this 5\u2011transistor OTA topology.\",\n  \"gmid1\": null,\n  \"L1_um\": null,\n  \"gmid3\": null,\n  \"L3_um\": null,\n  \"gmid5\": null,\n  \"L5_um\": null,\n  \"Itail_uA\": null\n}"